# longplay

English in code, docs, and prompts. Domain language: `docs/domain/ubiquitous-language.md`.

Harness lives in `harness/` (Agent Runtime). Apps in `apps/` only supply tools + policy (Session Soundtrack). GitHub holds code; Ollama and keys stay local.

- Do not add LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI, or LiteLLM.
- Swap models via env (`MODEL_*`, optional `FALLBACK_*`). Same `chat.completions`. No `if provider ==`.
- Never commit `.env`, tokens, or model weights.
- Phone calls `POST /runs`, not Ollama/OpenRouter.
- Change the loop only in `harness/`. Change catalog/session rules only in `apps/workout_album/`.
- Fit (album runtime vs session) beats listening taste.
